# Both Dockerfiles build with the repo root as context (the uv lockfile lives
# here). Allow-list only what they COPY, so .git, .venv, node_modules and the
# agent worktrees under .claude/ never enter a build context. Last match wins.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!api/pyproject.toml
!api/src
!worker/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
